{"prompt": {"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant that translates C++ code to Java 8 code. The code should reads and writes I/O from the console."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Translate the following GNU C++17 code to Java 8 code. The code reads and writes I/O from the console. Your translated code should have the exact same functionality as the given code, meaning that it should have the same output for any given input.\nPrint your translated code and also the confidence score you give to your translation. The confidence score should be a number between 0 and 1. The format of the output should be:\n<translated_code>\n<your_translated_code>\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n<your_confidence_score>\n</confidence>\nDo not provide any other text or markdown fences.\n\nHere is the original GNU C++17 code you have to translate:\n<original_code>\n#include <iostream>\n#include <vector>\n#include <numeric>\n#include <algorithm>\nusing namespace std;\nusing int64 = long long;\n\nconst int64 MOD = 1000000007LL;\n\nint64 fast_pow(int64 base, int64 exp, int64 mod) {\n    int64 res = 1;\n    while (exp) {\n        if (exp & 1) res = (res * base) % mod;\n        base = (base * base) % mod;\n        exp >>= 1;\n    }\n    return res;\n}\n\nstruct UnionFind {\n    vector<int> par, sz;\n    \n    UnionFind(int n) : par(n), sz(n, 1) {\n        iota(par.begin(), par.end(), 0);\n    }\n    \n    int root(int x) {\n        if (par[x] == x) return x;\n        return par[x] = root(par[x]);\n    }\n    \n    void join(int x, int y) {\n        x = root(x), y = root(y);\n        if (x == y) return;\n        if (sz[x] < sz[y]) swap(x, y);\n        par[y] = x;\n        sz[x] += sz[y];\n    }\n};\n\nint main() {\n    ios_base::sync_with_stdio(false);\n    cin.tie(nullptr);\n    \n    int n, k;\n    cin >> n >> k;\n    \n    if (k == 0) {\n        cout << fast_pow(n, n - 1, MOD) << '\\n';\n        return 0;\n    }\n    \n    UnionFind uf(n);\n    for (int i = 0; i < n; ++i) {\n        uf.join(i, (1LL * i * k) % n);\n    }\n    \n    int64 result = 1;\n    for (int i = 0; i < n; ++i) {\n        if (uf.root(i) != i) continue;\n        int64 comp_size = uf.sz[i];\n        int64 val = fast_pow(k, comp_size, n);\n        if (val == 1) {\n            result = (result * n) % MOD;\n        }\n    }\n    \n    cout << result << '\\n';\n    return 0;\n}\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "qwen/qwen3-coder-next"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\nimport java.util.*;\n\npublic class Main {\n    static final long MOD = 1000000007L;\n\n    static long fastPow(long base, long exp, long mod) {\n        long res = 1;\n        while (exp > 0) {\n            if ((exp & 1) == 1) {\n                res = (res * base) % mod;\n            }\n            base = (base * base) % mod;\n            exp >>= 1;\n        }\n        return res;\n    }\n\n    static class UnionFind {\n        int[] par;\n        int[] sz;\n\n        UnionFind(int n) {\n            par = new int[n];\n            sz = new int[n];\n            for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n                par[i] = i;\n                sz[i] = 1;\n            }\n        }\n\n        int root(int x) {\n            if (par[x] == x) return x;\n            return par[x] = root(par[x]);\n        }\n\n        void join(int x, int y) {\n            x = root(x);\n            y = root(y);\n            if (x == y) return;\n            if (sz[x] < sz[y]) {\n                int temp = x;\n                x = y;\n                y = temp;\n            }\n            par[y] = x;\n            sz[x] += sz[y];\n        }\n    }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);\n        \n        int n = sc.nextInt();\n        int k = sc.nextInt();\n        \n        if (k == 0) {\n            System.out.println(fastPow(n, n - 1, MOD));\n            return;\n        }\n        \n        UnionFind uf = new UnionFind(n);\n        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n            uf.join(i, (int)((1L * i * k) % n));\n        }\n        \n        long result = 1;\n        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n            if (uf.root(i) != i) continue;\n            int compSize = uf.sz[i];\n            long val = fastPow(k, compSize, n);\n            if (val == 1) {\n                result = (result * n) % MOD;\n            }\n        }\n        \n        System.out.println(result);\n    }\n}\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.95\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-0.00020394629973452538, -2.50339189733495e-06, -4.768370445162873e-07, -0.0009470268851146102, -1.9788545614574105e-05, -0.043071962893009186, -0.4748188853263855, -4.911301948595792e-05, -9.536738616588991e-07, -4.6967357775429264e-05, -0.002186171943321824, -0.00023052419419400394, -0.02272643707692623, -0.0002113357331836596, -0.0007250064518302679, -2.622600959512056e-06, 0.0, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -3.576278118089249e-07, -0.00010895135346800089, 0.0, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -1.2993727978027891e-05, 0.0, 0.0, -1.0490362910786644e-05, 0.0, -1.4781842764932662e-05, -0.0005588161875493824, -0.17974524199962616, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -0.0009145130170509219, -0.0009366653976030648, -2.062299427052494e-05, -0.00597974332049489, -3.2066785934148356e-05, -1.0728830375228426e-06, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -9.775113539944869e-06, -9.894321920000948e-06, -1.4305104514278355e-06, -6.556489552167477e-06, -2.145764938177308e-06, -2.264974000354414e-06, 0.0, -9.42901024245657e-05, -2.264974000354414e-06, -3.6000557884108275e-05, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0, -2.7418097943154862e-06, 0.0, -9.65590606938349e-06, 0.0, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -0.023246029391884804, 0.0, -1.1920928244535389e-07, 0.0, 0.0, -2.9802276912960224e-06, -1.1205610462639015e-05, -7.986990567587782e-06, -2.145764938177308e-06, -1.1920928244535389e-07, 0.0, 0.0, -4.768370445162873e-07, -9.655486064730212e-05, 0.0, 0.0, -1.6689160474925302e-05, -0.000645071791950